WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
I don't believe that either part of our mandate is generally at war with the other part.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
I do not believe that price stability and full employment is an either-or proposition.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.500
There have been policymakers over the last several generations who have thought that there is a strict tradeoff there.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:23.415
That isn't my judgment.
